                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "All Americans deserve life-saving care\u2014especially those with rare diseases. I\u2019m introducing the John W. Walsh Alpha-1 Home Infusion Act to ensure Alpha-1 patients get the treatment they need, at home.\n\nhttps://t.co/0AGJRL8HtU",
