                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "So many in FL-27 and around the nation rely on help to afford healthcare. \n\nThat\u2019s why I proudly co-sponsored the Bipartisan Premium Tax Credit Extension Act to keep coverage affordable, and support a 1-year extension for ACA subsidies. \n\nBUT this shutdown is hurting everyone. It\u2019s costing taxpayers MILLIONS a day and blocking essential services.",
